Package: soapysdr0.8-module-plutosdr
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: soapysdr0.8-module
Description: Pluto SDR device support for SoapySDR
 The Soapy Pluto SDR project provides a SoapySDR hardware support module.
 Using this, any program using SoapySDR to interface to software
 defined radio hardware can make use of Pluto SDR devices.

Package: soapysdr-module-plutosdr
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: soapysdr0.8-module-plutosdr, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Pluto SDR device support for SoapySDR (default version)
 The Soapy Pluto SDR project provides a SoapySDR hardware support module.
 Using this, any program using SoapySDR to interface to software
 defined radio hardware can make use of Pluto SDR devices.
 .
 This is an empty dependency package that pulls in the Pluto SDR module
 for the default version of libsoapysdr.
